ia, serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:22px;text-align:left;c=
olor:#121212;"><p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Football Daily has never ha=
d much time for conspiracy theories. Lee Harvey Oswald dunnit, Stanley Kubr=
ick didn=E2=80=99t fake the moon landing, Vin=C3=ADcius Jr <a href=3D"https=
://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.zFrJr-OAD6MUXPGxMNJG7LBdqR50x=
