style=3D"color: #0077B6;">Be Ready campaign</a> on Thursday night. In case =
you missed it, or live outside the UK and couldn=E2=80=99t care less about =
this weird little island, we=E2=80=99ve lifted this from our <a href=3D"htt=
ps://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ=
