<tr><td align=3D"left" class=3D"text" style=3D"background:#FFFFFF;font-size=
:0px;padding:0 60px 10px;word-break:break-word;"><div style=3D"font-family:=
Georgia, serif;font-size:16px;font-style:italic;line-height:24px;text-align=
:left;color:#121212;"><p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">=E2=80=9CEvery Brito=
n is being urged to stock up to nine litres of bottled water and three days=
=E2=80=99 worth of food in new government guidance designed to ensure that =
households can survive a weather, cyber or other serious emergency. The Be =
Ready campaign is aimed at persuading people to stock up with supplies to l=
ast 72 hours, amid growing official concern about the impact of the climate=
 crisis, technological dependency and hostile state threats.=E2=80=9D</p></=
div></td></tr>
<tr><td align=3D"left" class=3D"text" style=3D"background:#FFFFFF;font-size=
:0px;padding:0 16px;word-break:break-word;"><div style=3D"font-family:Georg=
ia, serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:22px;text-align:left;c=
olor:#121212;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">War=E2=80=99s a comin=E2=80=99, in other w=
ords, so you=E2=80=99d better buy some tomato soup (10 tins of), mushroom s=
oup (eight tins of, for consumption cold) and ice cream (vanilla, one large=
 tub of). Here=E2=80=99s where it gets interesting. The government released=
 their three-day survival plan on Thursday afternoon, three days before the=
 event most likely to cause World War III: Jos=C3=A9 Mourinho=E2=80=99s fir=
st Cl=C3=A1sico since 2013. Barcelona meet Real Madrid at the Camp Nou on S=
unday and suddenly the government are telling us we may need to hunker down=
. Coincidence? We think not!</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">OK, OK. Coincidence? We think so! Jos=C3=
=A9 may be the most charismatic baddie since Dirty Den=E2=80=99s most recen=
t death, but not even he is capable of starting the geopolitical answer to =
El Cl=C3=A1sico. Sunday=E2=80=99s match will spark a form of global conflic=
t, even if it=E2=80=99s just a load of strangers caterwauling at each other=
 on the internet rather than talking to their children, reading a book or p=
ractising any of the gazillion behaviours that would make their lives and t=
he world a better place.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.thegua=
rdian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBYsb93GJSEF_C=
1-UhtUYc3vfbupRiiAmT0Lzzq8NwPJjJc8LHHnCmhpBT9iuC9Z_K2iJzVUGSiv_FlxCQyDCN9Os=
p2bUzMAxh9u8tU2W0nGDH2YUa-w_JqKdPok9SqhynHoDTJ9NfbdDOWKdobMgpgu6jTFLXRBXUUx=
kRlCK6A6qIDgKKTvIZDRNgpUDjUNINjYQRTZcl8WJBEaerifXQT7SW_efylTkICJFlBEGIga-N9=
UtVCLoePSPMMRyvLD0DZNykCKW5neeGadY5r94y8/4v4/2uj_ctUHQcG7LlK9IQUcwg/h31/h00=
1.ofWdphEXnQtb2-KRaE62WceVjkjnkP61JMruv1bsva4" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">Mo=
urinho=E2=80=99s relationship with Barcelona</a> could fill a book, never m=
ind a teatime email. There <em>is </em>love lost, but it=E2=80=99s decades =
since it went missing. These days they can=E2=80=99t stand the thought of e=
ach other, never mind the sight. There is an argument (NB: Football Daily d=
oesn=E2=80=99t actually want to argue) that Mourinho=E2=80=99s greatest ach=
ievement in football, apart from finishing second with Manchester United in=
 2017-18, was to take a La Liga title off probably the greatest club side o=
f all time. He also drove Pep Guardiola into a sabbatical =E2=80=93 but tha=
t, and the Realpolitik of the Bernab=C3=A9u dressing-room, took so much out=
 of Mourinho that he has never been the same since that triumphant 2011-12 =
season.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The Camp Nou was the venue for Mourinho=E2=
=80=99s =E2=80=9Cmost beautiful defeat=E2=80=9D (<a href=3D"https://ablink.=
editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSn=
eHECoBtcQjat6FvTX4oDJNDqNHfNPa8ylSp-YvOwx-bOX66VvyXgwhrJEq1UEt_2oadkvJC1iVu=
qMkLGQw_V08YFAk7_i5gJy9b8zeAYhnnAZ-O6yA4EoDiQG2543drsxZj26UUoi9CL_otg3hpZK1=
NyLTHtFfe6yJ6nMXntZLdf5EMIBH48GQkQ1tzJ9pprPQgUobIsflJqMXDOzLNsDcilyBbAWP-i_=
K-YCvp1gsIh9gLjfDGxULpk_CekpL9zocv_lj8aW4ZR31RYEClrieXZE/4v4/2uj_ctUHQcG7Ll=
K9IQUcwg/h32/h001.yvm3lqHPQDllMbZPJ4JCyEW46KZetGy3KjPZn1N4nOs" style=3D"col=
or: #0077B6;">you know the one</a>, when not even a good hosing could douse=
 his celebrations) and <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/=
ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHECCfuuR4dHJGEN7u2do0Yqh2=
IuKe4TyuQYMI6s9IhFCtpIi0sXxgNnqLbsJ7fLaSOcEBJ-hWsnusqH0ttG00aw9CXDRdpJ5JW3a=
Ak7IR53yEaHNU65k72_jG-x98_56Ay2r0u3YMICVfV4RPT8e8xuJ_RZdi9Js62yOXPaoSDSAQ2x=
rgFtITLYJDX-IEUOqCZFwuloHorXAwmQ0_bLug-eibpJOeApjTUVH_lc_Rc0C8A/4v4/2uj_ctU=
HQcG7LlK9IQUcwg/h33/h001.Ih7NqtetAyZL3Ih6AnvdB-U6ev67wqU0osihBhGSQFg" style=
=3D"color: #0077B6;">his most humiliating</a> defeat a few months later. He=
 can=E2=80=99t afford any kind of defeat on Sunday: Madrid are six points b=
ehind Barcelona, who have won all nine league games, scoring 39 goals in th=
e process. But Mourinho=E2=80=99s team have scored four goals in each of th=
eir last three matches and, even in the absence of the suspended Vin=C3=ADc=
ius Jr , have attacking threats galore. And whatever the result, Mourinho=
=E2=80=99s post-match press conference will be must-see TV.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The match kicks off on Sunday evening, but=
 only if you take these things literally. For Mourinho, it began the moment=
 he was asked a question about it. He has had the face on all week because,=
 well, wouldn=E2=80=99t you if you were treated like this? Barcelona played=
 24 hours earlier than Madrid in Bigger Cup, an open goal for conspiracy th=
eorists and performative underdogs. =E2=80=9CWe=E2=80=99re pushing ahead,=
=E2=80=9D he said. =E2=80=9CAt the moment, we=E2=80=99re missing out on 24 =
hours of rest, but we=E2=80=99re moving forward.=E2=80=9D So is Football Da=
ily, to the supermarket to get some urgent shopping. We=E2=80=99ll Be Ready=
 for Sunday =E2=80=93 not with 72 hours of essential supplies, but with a m=
onth=E2=80=99s worth of popcorn.</p>
